{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6fb0832028ed3b5b","name":"Korunnai Adept Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-6fb0832028ed3b5b","title":"Korunnai Adept Talent Tree","revision":19962,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:56:11Z","sha256":"d606716b8cdfaa5bd16c85387b180faf6ea53cc130d5d3da16054756cd0fa091","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19962","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Korunnai%20Adept%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6fb0832028ed3b5b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned to use ",{"tag":"i","children":["Pelekotan"]}," to survive in the jungles of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Haruun Kal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Haruun_Kal?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and have bonded with an Akk Dog, which serves you faithfully. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Korunnai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Korunnai","referenceId":"reference:e994ff52a35bf5d9"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Akk Dog Master"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain an Akk Dog ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"},". Choose either an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aggressive Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aggressive_Follower","referenceId":"reference:8997870790dd9c1a"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defensive Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defensive_Follower","referenceId":"reference:51d1c3842bf4509b"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Utility Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Utility_Follower"},", and generate the Akk Dog Follower's statistics using the Akk Dog Follower Template. The Akk Dog Follower automatically gains the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Attack","referenceId":"reference:001392d9f8729e21"}," Feat as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},". Additionally, any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," you activate that targets you can target your Akk Dog Follower instead, at your discretion. An Akk Dog counts toward the total number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," you have, just like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," gained from other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Akk Dog Follower Template"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When a character gains an Akk Dog Follower, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"}," gains the Species Traits of the Akk Dog described below. Akk Dogs are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beasts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beasts"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Scores:"]}," Akk Dogs have set ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Scores"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Scores"},". They use the following statistics: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," 16, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 8, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," 12, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," 10, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," 2, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 8."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Large Size:"]}," Akk Dogs take a -1 size penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and a -5 size penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks. Their lifting and carrying capacities are double those of Medium creatures."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," An Akk Dog has a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Natural Armor:"]}," Akk Dogs gain a +2 Natural Armor bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Natural Weapons:"]}," When an Akk Dog makes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," attack, it can use its Natural Weapons, dealing 1d6 points of Slashing damage (plus its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier) with that attack instead of normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," damage."]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Akk Dog Trainer's Actions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Akk Dog Master"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You and your Akk Dog have bonded through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," and can fight in concert. You can use any of the following actions on your turn:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Attack in Concert:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a target in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". If your Akk Dog Follower is adjacent to the target and your attack hits, the target also takes Piercing damage equal to 1d6 + the Akk Dog's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["This additional damage is considered part of your attack for the purposes of resolving damage, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},", and overcoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},"."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Fall Upon Prey:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a target in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", and your Akk Dog can take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," Action against a target within its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". However, both you and your Akk Dog take a -5 penalty on your attack rolls (this replaces the bonus to attack rolls granted by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," Action)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Paired Maul:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a target in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". If the attack hits, your Akk Dog Follower gains a +2 competence bonus on its next attack roll against that target."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Akk Dog Attack Training"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Akk Dog Master"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your Akk Dog Follower gains the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Powerful Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Powerful_Charge","referenceId":"reference:d7f59c39adb93fd7"}," Feat.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Protective Reaction"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Akk Dog Master"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are targeted by an attack made by an enemy adjacent to your Akk Dog Follower, that attacker provokes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," from your Akk Dog Follower.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
